      "decay": {"5d_ic": 0.023739, "5d_icir": 0.075439, "10d_ic": 0.027794, "10d_icir": 0.084006},
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "10-day IC remained positive across 2020-2024 (+0.033199), 2025-2027 (+0.031561), 2028-2029 (+0.003629), and 2030-2031-12-24 (+0.040346). The 2028-2029 regime was weak; the full-sample ICIR only narrowly clears the benchmark gate, so uncertainty is material in the 15-instrument cross-section.",
